   <H1>[Python-ideas] PEP 572 version 2: Statement-Local Name Bindings</H1>
    <B>Guido van Rossum</B> 
    <A HREF="mailto:python-ideas%40python.org?Subject=Re%3A%20%5BPython-ideas%5D%20PEP%20572%20version%202%3A%20Statement-Local%20Name%20Bindings&In-Reply-To=%3CCAP7%2BvJJP2gB0WgK4XvL4MxZEg3dGL95O7xBs1D7ebNRcxuN5-Q%40mail.gmail.com%3E"
       TITLE="[Python-ideas] PEP 572 version 2: Statement-Local Name Bindings">guido at python.org
       </A><BR>
    <I>Fri Mar 23 12:58:13 EDT 2018</I>
    <P><UL>
        <LI>Previous message (by thread): <A HREF="049408.html">[Python-ideas] PEP 572 version 2: Statement-Local Name Bindings
</A></li>
